 "remarks": "A FANTASTIC NEW LUXURY CONDO in the heart of amazing SONO!   Crazy amazing views from way up and totally updated!   This 2 BR 2 Bath condo has it all. Roomy and well laid out - with 9 foot ceilings and floor to ceiling windows everywhere!!! Primary BR is spacious with full walk in closet and large Full Bath.  Second BR (can be used as office or den also) has its own full bath.  Deck off living room overlooking Norwalk.   Clubroom, Fitness center, Conference room, large secure garage, extra spots in the parking lot, Available for a VERY quick close if needed.    Walk to the train, walk to SONO for the best restaurants, shops, etc, and SONO Mall is right around the corner!  Across the street from the BEST aquarium in New England!",
